message: "If you use this dataset, cite it as below. Attribution is a condition of the CC BY 4.0 licence, not a courtesy."
title: "KDUA-Mobile: Ukrainian mobile keystroke dynamics with motion sensors"
abstract: >-
  498 typing sessions from 71 people on 56 Android phones, recorded with a
  custom input method: key press and release timings, per-key touch geometry,
  and accelerometer, gyroscope, magnetometer and rotation vector streams at a
  requested 200 Hz. Ukrainian text on the ЙЦУКЕН layout. The design breaks the
  confounding of person and device from both sides, with 14 devices used by two
  or more people and 11 people recorded on two devices, and it measures whether
  the posture condition asked of the participant actually held, instead of
  assuming it.
